<title>USA: TABLE - Crown Cork &amp; Seal Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Crown Cork &amp; Seal Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.98		    $0.76</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.94		     0.74</p>
<p> Net			132,000		  104,100</p>
<p> Revs		   2,286,600		2,353,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     129,228		  128,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     140,554		  139,826</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.23		    $1.09</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.22		     1.09</p>
<p> Net			171,000		  135,400</p>
<p> Revs		   4,223,900		3,904,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     129,208		  116,935</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     140,533		  124,778</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1997 Q2 net sales marginally lower than Q2 1996 due to stronger U.S. dollar vs European currency; operations divested after Q2 1996; and pass-through of lower raw materials costs to customers.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Crown Cork &amp; Seal Co Inc.</p>
